      "caption": "so a customer last week saw me pull up on a delivery and asked why my helmet ears light up.\ntold him they're my turn signals now — right ear glows, i'm going right. he thought i was \njoking. i was not joking.\n\nhonestly? been riding with them a few weeks and it's better than the factory blinkers. \nthe only problem is nobody behind me knows the rules yet lol.\n\nok serious question though — is this actually legal, or am i one cop away from a very \nconfusing conversation? 🐾 and what do both ears at once mean — hazards, or \"i'm lost\"? \ndecide in the comments ↓\n\n#nightride #catears #motogirl",
